message: >-
  If you use Trasgu in your research, please cite the software using the
  metadata below.
type: software
title: Trasgu
version: 0.1.0
license: MIT
authors:
  - family-names: Fernández-Quiruelas
    given-names: Valvanuz
    orcid: https://orcid.org/0000-0003-2050-6087
    affiliation: >-
      Departamento de Matemática Aplicada y Ciencias de la Computación,
