repository-code: https://github.com/SantanderMetGroup/trasgu
abstract: >-
  Trasgu is a command-line toolkit for fitting vine copulas over structured
  Chimera Zarr matrices using local or SLURM-backed Snakemake workflows.
keywords:
  - vine copulas
  - Chimera
  - Snakemake
  - scientific computing
